Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:48:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(sannlab): appearance settings activity + context
 menu entry

- SannLabSettingsActivity (AppCompatActivity, exported=false, no new
  permissions): system document pickers for image/video/font, copies picks
  into app-owned storage ($HOME/.termux/sannlab/ and the standard
  $HOME/.termux/font.ttf for fonts), sliders for opacity/overlay/brightness/
  blur, scale and video fps radio groups, AMOLED switch. All changes are
  written to termux.properties immediately via SannLabConfig.
- AndroidManifest: declare the settings activity.
- TermuxActivity: 'SannLab Wallpaper' entry in the terminal long-press
  context menu.
